# Session-local measurement notes. Receipt tree digests fold untracked
# paths, so scratch that comes and goes must not perturb them.
/local/

# The tracked completion program binds .outline/gates/*.md as product
# authority, so those ledgers belong in the repository. Excluding
# .outline is a machine-local global rule, not this repository's policy.
# Re-include the directory so git descends, re-exclude its other
# children, then admit only the gate ledgers and the root contract.
!/.outline/
/.outline/*
!/.outline/gates/
!/.outline/GATES.md
!/.outline/type-script-7.0.2-completion.md
/tasks/
